{"seq":2,"slug":"per-language-pair-metrics","title":"按语言对分别评估召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/clir-evaluation/per-language-pair-metrics","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"按语言对分别评估召回\">按语言对分别评估召回</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨语言检索最容易被一个全局平均数毁掉。假设你支持 10 个语言对，其中德语→英语提升 15 个点、法语→英语提升 8 个点，而阿拉伯语→英语下降 12 个点、泰语→英语下降 20 个点。取平均，你得到「整体提升 0% 左右」——一个关于所有语言对都毫无信息、且会让你误判「跨语言没用」的数字。反过来，若法语→英语的召回率本身很高（0.85），德语→英语 0.9，而泰语→英语只有 0.3，全局平均 0.68 看起来「还行」，掩盖了泰语用户实际拿到的是一个坏掉的搜索。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么本章的第一句话是：<strong>跨语言检索的评估单位是语言对，不是站点，不是语言，甚至不是「跨语言」这个整体概念</strong>。语言对而不是语言，因为方向很重要——英语查询检索德语文档与德语查询检索英语文档是两个不同的系统行为，翻译方向不同、索引不同、用户预期也不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;评估需求&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;按语言对拆分&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;同语言基线&lt;br/&gt;lang X → lang X&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;跨语言实测&lt;br/&gt;lang X → lang Y&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;对齐落差 Delta&lt;br/&gt;跨语言相对单语言的损失&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;Delta 是否可接受&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;观察长期趋势&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;按语言对诊断&lt;br/&gt;见下节拆分维度&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;翻译质量 / 对齐 / 词典覆盖 / 文档缺失&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"评估需求\"] --&gt; B[\"按语言对拆分\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"同语言基线&lt;br/&gt;lang X → lang X\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"跨语言实测&lt;br/&gt;lang X → lang Y\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"对齐落差 Delta&lt;br/&gt;跨语言相对单语言的损失\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{\"Delta 是否可接受\"}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"观察长期趋势\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"按语言对诊断&lt;br/&gt;见下节拆分维度\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"翻译质量 / 对齐 / 词典覆盖 / 文档缺失\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心指标-对齐落差而非绝对召回\">核心指标：对齐落差而非绝对召回</h2><p>单语言检索的评估用 Recall@k 或 nDCG@k 的绝对值就够了——你知道 0.7 是好、0.4 是差。跨语言不一样，因为<strong>绝对值的可接受范围随语言对变化</strong>，而变化的根源往往不在跨语言这件事本身。</p>\n<p>德语→英语的 Recall@10 是 0.62，这个数字好还是不好？无法判断，除非你比较德语→德语（0.68）与英语→英语（0.72）。前者说明跨语言让你损失了 6 个点，后者说明还差 10 个点。真正的目标变量是<strong>对齐落差</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{X \\to Y} = \\frac{R_{X \\to X} - R_{X \\to Y}}{R_{X \\to X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它衡量「用母语检索自己的文档」到「用母语检索另一语言的文档」损失了多少相对比例。这个定义有三个好处：</p>\n<p><strong>好处一：可比性。</strong> 不同语言的检索质量基线差异很大（泰语分词难、阿拉伯语形态复杂，同语言 Recall 天然低于英语），用相对落差可以把「该语言本身的检索难度」这个因素除掉，让语言对之间的对齐质量可以横向比较。</p>\n<p><strong>好处二：有明确的目标。</strong> 单语言检索就是一个天然的上界（它不需要跨语言），所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的语义是「我们离上界还有多远」。目标是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 尽量小，这与业务目标（用户不该因为语言而得到更差的结果）直接对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>好处三：能区分问题归属。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{X \\to X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 0.4（本身差），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 很小，说明问题在单语言检索侧，先修分词与索引；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{X \\to X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 0.8 而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 0.4，说明跨语言环节是瓶颈，该做对齐或翻译质量。这个区分能防止把跨语言团队的资源投到单语言问题上。</p>\n<p>一条经验阈值：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span> 通常可接受，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%–30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%–30%</span></span></span></span></span> 需要说明理由并规划改进，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 该语言对的跨语言检索不应默认对用户开放</strong>。这些数字需要按业务容忍度调整，但它们给出了一个可操作的判断尺度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆成可行动的维度\">拆成可行动的维度</h2><p>一个语言对的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 不好，本身不构成行动指令。要定位原因，需要在语言对内部再做两层拆分。</p>\n<p><strong>按意图类型拆。</strong> 复用第三章讨论过的查询分类（品牌/型号类、类目浏览类、属性约束类、自然语言长查询、混语言查询），分别算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。每种类型的失效对应不同的修复方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>意图类型</th>\n<th>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 高，指向的问题</th>\n<th>修复方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌/型号类</td>\n<td>保护策略失效、别名表缺项</td>\n<td><a href=\"../translation-quality/brand-term-preserve\">品牌词保护</a>、<a href=\"../translation-quality/transliteration\">音译匹配</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目浏览类</td>\n<td>翻译或向量的类目词对齐差</td>\n<td>术语词典、领域微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性约束类</td>\n<td>漏译（约束被丢弃）</td>\n<td>词项覆盖检查、属性结构化检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然语言长查询</td>\n<td>向量对齐不足</td>\n<td><a href=\"../multilingual-embeddings/embedding-alignment\">领域微调</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混语言查询</td>\n<td>语言识别与路由错误</td>\n<td><a href=\"../multilingual-embeddings/vector-lexical-hybrid-clir\">混合检索语言分段</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的价值在于它把「跨语言效果差」这个笼统问题变成了一个具体的工程项。看到「品牌/型号类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 高而自然语言类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 低」，你就知道不该去动模型，该去补别名表。</p>\n<p><strong>按召回深度拆。</strong> 分别看 Recall@5、@10、@50、@100。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在 @5 高但在 @100 低，说明候选池里有正确文档但排序把它压下去了——这是排序问题。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在 @100 也高，说明正确文档根本不在候选池里——这是召回或翻译问题。这个区分决定了改动落在召回层还是排序层，是最容易做也最容易被跳过的一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;语言对 Delta 偏高&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;按深度拆: @100 是否也差?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;@5差 @100 好&quot;| C[&quot;候选池有正确文档&lt;br/&gt;→ 排序/融合问题&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;@100 也差&quot;| D[&quot;正确文档未进候选池&lt;br/&gt;→ 召回问题&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;按意图类型拆&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;品牌型号类差&lt;br/&gt;→ 别名/保护&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;属性约束类差&lt;br/&gt;→ 漏译/词项覆盖&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;自然语言类差&lt;br/&gt;→ 向量对齐&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;检查该语言对&lt;br/&gt;词项保留率&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; J[&quot;检查平行对&lt;br/&gt;相似度 gap&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"语言对 Delta 偏高\"] --&gt; B{\"按深度拆: @100 是否也差?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"@5差 @100 好\"| C[\"候选池有正确文档&lt;br/&gt;→ 排序/融合问题\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"@100 也差\"| D[\"正确文档未进候选池&lt;br/&gt;→ 召回问题\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"按意图类型拆\"}\n    C --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"品牌型号类差&lt;br/&gt;→ 别名/保护\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"属性约束类差&lt;br/&gt;→ 漏译/词项覆盖\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"自然语言类差&lt;br/&gt;→ 向量对齐\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"检查该语言对&lt;br/&gt;词项保留率\"]\n    H --&gt; J[\"检查平行对&lt;br/&gt;相似度 gap\"]</pre><h2 id=\"样本量与置信区间\">样本量与置信区间</h2><p>按语言对拆分会立刻面临样本量问题：每个语言对的标注查询只有 50–150 条，指标的置信区间很宽。50 条查询上算出的 Recall@10 与 150 条上的同名指标，其噪声水平差三倍。</p>\n<p>Recall@10 在单条查询上是「前 10 条里是否含正例」的伯努利变量，因此指标的标准误可以用二项分布近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>95% CI</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1.96</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SE} = \\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}{n}}, \\quad \\text{95\\% CI} \\approx p \\pm 1.96 \\cdot \\mathrm{SE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">95% CI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入具体数字，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.069</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SE} = 0.069</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.069</span></span></span></span></span>，置信区间约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.46</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.74</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0.46, 0.74]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.46</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.74</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>——宽达 28 个点。这意味着<strong>在 50 条查询上比较两个系统，只有差异超过 15–20 个点才能说是可信的</strong>。这个结论非常重要，它直接否定了「用 50 条查询做 A/B 选型」的做法。</p>\n<p>应对有三条：<strong>增加标注量</strong>（每对 150+ 才适合做对比）、<strong>配对比较降低方差</strong>（用同一批查询跑两个系统，看逐查询的胜负比例而不是比两个独立均值，配对设计能显著降低方差）、<strong>用连续指标代替二元指标</strong>（nDCG 利用了分级相关性，方差低于二元的 Recall@k）。</p>\n<p>配对比较的具体做法：对每条查询，记录系统 A 与系统 B 是否命中正例，得到四格表（A命中B命中 / A命中B不命中 / A不命中B命中 / 都不命中）。只看<strong>不一致的格子</strong>（后两者），若 B 命中的格子显著多于 A，则 B 更好。这个检验（McNemar 检验）只看不一致对，样本效率远高于比较两个独立比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长期监控与回归\">长期监控与回归</h2><p>评估集是一次性投入，监控是持续投入。两者应当共用同一套指标口径，且回归门要设在<strong>语言对层面</strong>而不是全局：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控层级</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 变化 &gt; 5 点</td>\n<td>人工检查（可能是某个语言对塌了）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言对</td>\n<td>单对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 变化 &gt; 10 点</td>\n<td>阻塞发布，定位原因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>意图类型</td>\n<td>单类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 变化 &gt; 15 点</td>\n<td>记录，观察下一个窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言对基线</td>\n<td>单对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{X\\to X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变化 &gt; 10 点</td>\n<td>检查单语言侧（分词、索引）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一行与第二行的关系值得强调：全局监控只能用于<strong>发现异常</strong>，不能用于判断好坏；语言对监控才是<strong>决策依据</strong>。很多团队只做全局监控，结果是每次发布都「平均没变」，而实际上有的语言对在持续退化、有的在持续改进，两者互相抵消。定期（每季度）打印一次全语言对的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 表格，是防止这种隐蔽退化的最便宜手段。</p>\n<p>线上指标（零结果率、点击率、转化率）应当与离线语言对指标<strong>交叉验证</strong>。若离线显示某语言对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 改善但线上零结果率没降，说明离线标注集在该语言对上不代表真实流量分布（可能采样偏了）。这个不一致本身就是有价值的发现——它指出你的评估集需要更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨语言评估的单位是<strong>语言对</strong>而非站点或语言整体；全局平均数会双向掩盖问题。</li>\n<li>核心指标是对齐落差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>同语言</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>跨语言</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>同语言</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = (R_{\\text{同语言}} - R_{\\text{跨语言}}) / R_{\\text{同语言}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">同语言</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">跨语言</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">同语言</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它把语言自身的检索难度除掉，且能区分问题归属（单语言侧 vs 跨语言侧）。</li>\n<li>经验阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span> 可接受，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%–30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%–30%</span></span></span></span></span> 需规划改进，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 不应默认对用户开放。</li>\n<li>两层拆分定位原因：按召回深度拆（区分召回问题与排序问题）、按意图类型拆（映射到具体修复方向）。</li>\n<li>50 条查询上 Recall@k 的 95% 置信区间宽达 28 点，做对比至少需要 150 条，且应当用配对比较（McNemar）而非比两独立均值。</li>\n<li>回归门要设在语言对层面；全局监控只用于发现异常。离线指标必须与线上零结果率交叉验证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：离线指标达标后如何灰度上线、以及给长尾语言留什么样的人工兜底，见 <a href=\"clir-ab-launch\">跨语言检索灰度与人工兜底</a>；标注集本身的构建方法见 <a href=\"cross-lingual-relevance-set\">构建跨语言相关性标注集</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按语言对分别评估召回","id":"按语言对分别评估召回"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心指标：对齐落差而非绝对召回","id":"核心指标-对齐落差而非绝对召回"},{"level":2,"text":"拆成可行动的维度","id":"拆成可行动的维度"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量与置信区间","id":"样本量与置信区间"},{"level":2,"text":"长期监控与回归","id":"长期监控与回归"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"构建跨语言相关性标注集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/clir-evaluation/cross-lingual-relevance-set"},"next":{"title":"跨语言检索灰度与人工兜底","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/clir-evaluation/clir-ab-launch"}}